The plot is saved in a dated subfolder
(\code{format(Sys.time(), "\%d\%b\%Y")}) inside \code{"Figs_Mantel"}, in
the formats selected by \code{file_formats}. The dated subfolder means
repeated runs do not overwrite each other.
